 style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, under <a href=\"#/wiki/Talphion\">Talphion</a> behind sealed door, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32537,31898,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32537, 31898, 13)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA dwarf henchman attacks in melee range. A dwarf henchman never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tKill these fast with area attack spells like <a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Caldera\">Divine Caldera</a>/<a href=\"#/wiki/Groundshaker\">Groundshaker</a> or runes such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">GFB</a>. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Dispenser\">Dwarf Dispenser</a> summons an unlimited amount of them. The faster you do it the less you will waste. A group of 3 mages throwing <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">Great Fireballs</a>, should kill them fast with little problem.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 3,572 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"100.000000\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dwarves\">Dwarves</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Axeitus%20Headbanger\">Axeitus Headbanger</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Captured%20Dwarf\">Captured Dwarf</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crazed%20Dwarf\">Crazed Dwarf</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">Dwarf</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Geomancer\">Dwarf Geomancer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Guard\">Dwarf Guard</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Miner\">Dwarf Miner</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Soldier\">Dwarf Soldier</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elvira%20Hammerthrust\">Elvira Hammerthrust</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Enslaved%20Dwarf\">Enslaved Dwarf</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Foreman%20Kneebiter\">Foreman Kneebiter</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grodrik%20%28Creature%29\">Grodrik (Creature)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Basher\">Lost Basher</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Berserker\">Lost Berserker</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Exile\">Lost Exile</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Husher\">Lost Husher</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lost%20Thrower\">Lost Thrower</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mad%20Technomancer\">Mad Technomancer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Memory%20of%20a%20Dwarf\">Memory of a Dwarf</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":["secret-service-quest"]}